DESCRIPTION:Venue: Matchai and Coffee : 10 Rue La Boétie\, 75008 Paris\nCO
 FFEE PARTY - Sip\, Vibe & Repeat! Have you ever thought of partying in a c
 offee shop? Well\, now is your chance! Come hang out\, sip on some really 
 good coffee\, and enjoy great music in a cozy café atmosphere. Not a coff
 ee person? No worries\, other drinks are on the menu too :) ???? DJ set + 
 a secret guest ☕ Good coffee\, good drinks (1 drink is included in your 
 ticket) ✨ International crowd\, new connections ???? November 14th\, 202
 6 - from 2 PM to 6 PM Bring your friends\, meet new people\, grab your fav
 orite drink\, and let’s turn an ordinary afternoon into something specia
 l!\n\nhttps://www.billetweb.fr/coffee-party1
