SUMMARY:Movie Night Amélie Poulain
LOCATION:l’Épée de Bois\, 100 Rue Mouffetard\, 75005 Paris
URL:https://www.billetweb.fr/movie-night-amelie
DESCRIPTION:Venue: l’Épée de Bois\, 100 Rue Mouffetard\, 75005 Paris\nM
 ovie Night: Amélie ✨ Ready for a proper French cinema night in the hear
 t of the Quartier Latin? Join us on Sunday\, November 15th for a screening
  of Le Fabuleux Destin d’Amélie Poulain (in French with English subtitl
 es). ???? We’ll grab drinks first at 7 PM\, followed by the movie screen
 ing at 8 PM\, both at Cinéma Épée du Bois. Amélie is an absolute Frenc
 h classic\, and frankly\, it's pretty much impossible to live in Paris wit
 hout seeing this movie! It showcases so many spots across Paris\, so it’
 ll be super fun recognising places you’ve seen in real life or discoveri
 ng brand-new hidden corners as the film goes. It follows Amélie\, a quiet
  young waitress caught up in her own imaginative world\, who decides to se
 cretly help the people around her find happiness. Her quest to spread joy 
 ultimately leads her to true love. Don't worry if your French is a bit rus
 ty: the film has English subtitles\, so everyone can follow along! ???? ??
 ??️ Spots available: 20 - grab yours quick\, space is pretty limited!\n\
 nhttps://www.billetweb.fr/movie-night-amelie
END:VEVENT
