SUMMARY:Hiking along the Yerres
LOCATION:Gare de Lyon
URL:https://www.billetweb.fr/hiking-along-the-yerres
DESCRIPTION:Venue: Gare de Lyon\nHey everyone! Ready for a little escape fr
 om Paris? ????✨ Join us on November 15\, 2026 for a day full of nature a
 nd good vibes with ESN! ✨ ???? Meeting point: 11:10 AM at Gare de Lyon W
 e’ll enjoy a 9 km scenic walk along the Yerres River\, surrounded by nat
 ure and away from the hustle and bustle of the city. ???? It’s the perfe
 ct opportunity to meet new people\, get some fresh air\, and enjoy a relax
 ing day away from Paris! ???? If the weather isn’t on our side\, we’ll
  swap the walk for a cozy time at a bar instead! ????✨ ⚠️ ESNcard ma
 ndatory\n\nhttps://www.billetweb.fr/hiking-along-the-yerres
END:VEVENT
