SUMMARY:Paris Is A Joke - Standup Comedy In English - from 11.00 EUR
LOCATION:176 Rue Montmartre\, 75002 Paris\, France
URL:https://shotgun.live/en/events/paris-is-a-joke-standup-comedy-in-englis
 h-2
DESCRIPTION:Price: from 11.00 EUR\nVenue: 176 Rue Montmartre\, 75002 Paris\
 , France\n🎤🇫🇷 PARIS IS A JOKE - EPISODE 2! 😂 🔥 AFTER A SOLD
 -OUT FIRST EDITION\, WE'RE BACK! You laughed\, you loved it\, and you aske
 d for more… So here we go again! 🎤 PARIS ERASMUS LIFE brings you anot
 her unforgettable night of international stand-up comedy in the heart of P
 aris! 🌍 Different Nationalities. Different Cultures. One Language: LAUG
 HTER! From French stereotypes to cultural clashes\, Erasmus adventures\, d
 ating disasters and the everyday madness of living in Paris… Nothing is 
 off-limits! 😂 ✨ WHAT TO EXPECT? 🎤 International stand-up comedians
  😂 100% Comedy in ENGLISH 🌍 Cultural differences & hilarious stereot
 ypes 🇫🇷 Jokes about Parisian life 🤝 Meet internationals\, expats 
 & Erasmus students 🍸 Drinks\, laughter & great vibes! 📅 SUNDAY\, NOV
 EMBER 15TH\, 2026 🕖 Doors Open: 7:00 PM 📍 ENVOLE MOI - 176 Rue Montm
 artre\, Paris 2nd 🚇 Grands Boulevards / Bourse 🎟️ START AT €10 -
  LIMITED SPOTS! Our first edition SOLD OUT\, so don't wait until the last 
 minute to grab your ticket! ❤️ Whether you're French\, Erasmus\, expat
  or just visiting Paris\, everyone is welcome! Paris is a joke. And we're 
 just getting started! 🇫🇷😂\n\nhttps://shotgun.live/en/events/paris
 -is-a-joke-standup-comedy-in-english-2
END:VEVENT
